@* 
Each line of music notes is a single table row. 
Each line of lyrics is also a single row.  
Each set of music notes and lyrics should be a single table.
For each table, it should have a matching number of columns for the notes and words (lyrics).
It is sometimes necessary to add a note in between words. It can also be necessary at times to add a note before or after a word; hence, 
there must be a capability to add a blank space/empty word in any place, and put a note/chord above the blank word.
*@
